$
# Host and IPs -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Hostname             web-01$
   -  vmbr0                192.0.2.20/24$
$
# Users --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  None but root$
$
# CPU and Load -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Model                Intel(R) Xeon(R) Gold 6338 CPU @ 2...$
   -  CPUs                 48, 2 sockets$
   -  Load (1, 5, 15 min)  0.12, 0.08, 0.03$
$
# Disk ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  /                    rpool/ROOT/pve-1 zfs$
   -  Used                 50.0 of 450.0 GiB (11%)$
  [+] Pool rpool           ONLINE$
$
# Memory -------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Used                 33.3 of 125.0 GiB (27%)$
$
# Last Login ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  root                 Oct 20 11:42 from 192.0.2.10$
